#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:1
msgid "Rust 加速模块"
msgstr "Rust Acceleration Module"

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:3
msgid ""
"nearlink-sdr 提供可选的 Rust 加速扩展，用于加速 Polar 编解码等计算密集型操作。安装后无需修改任何代码，Python "
"模块会自动检测并使用 Rust 实现。"
msgstr ""
"nearlink-sdr provides an optional Rust acceleration extension for speeding "
"up compute-intensive operations such as Polar encoding/decoding. After "
"installation, no code changes are needed — Python modules automatically "
"detect and use the Rust implementation."

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:5
msgid "前提条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:7
msgid "Rust 工具链 (cargo, rustc)：通过 [rustup](https://rustup.rs/) 安装"
msgstr ""
"Rust toolchain (cargo, rustc): Install via [rustup](https://rustup.rs/)"

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:8
msgid "Python 开发头文件（多数系统已默认包含）"
msgstr "Python development headers (included by default on most systems)"

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:10
msgid "安装方式"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:12
msgid "自动安装"
msgstr "Automatic Installation"

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:14
msgid "项目提供了一键安装脚本："
msgstr "The project provides a one-click installation script:"

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:20
msgid ""
"脚本会依次检查 Rust 工具链、安装 maturin 构建工具、编译并安装加速模块。安装失败不会影响项目正常使用，所有功能会回退到纯 Python "
"实现。"
msgstr ""
"The script sequentially checks the Rust toolchain, installs the maturin "
"build tool, then compiles and installs the acceleration module. Installation"
" failure does not affect normal project usage — all features fall back to "
"pure Python implementation."

