#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:65
msgid ""
"Rust 源码位于 `rust/src/lib.rs`，通过 PyO3 暴露为 Python 类，由 maturin 构建为本地扩展模块 "
"`nearlink_sdr_accel`。"
msgstr ""
"The Rust source is located at `rust/src/lib.rs` and is exposed as Python "
"classes via PyO3, built by maturin into the native extension module "
"`nearlink_sdr_accel`."

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:67
msgid "故障排除"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:69
msgid ""
"**cargo 未找到**：运行 `curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs "
"| sh` 安装 Rust 工具链。"
msgstr ""
"**cargo not found**: Run `curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf "
"https://sh.rustup.rs | sh` to install the Rust toolchain."

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:71
msgid "**编译失败**：确保 Rust 版本 >= 1.70，运行 `rustup update` 更新。"
msgstr ""
"**Build failure**: Ensure Rust version >= 1.70; run `rustup update` to "
"upgrade."

#: ../../how-to/rust-acceleration.md:73
msgid ""
"**maturin 找不到虚拟环境**：确认当前处于项目根目录的虚拟环境中（`source .venv/bin/activate` 或 `uv "
"sync` 后执行）。"
msgstr ""
"**maturin cannot find virtual environment**: Verify you are in the project "
"root's virtual environment (`source .venv/bin/activate` or run `uv sync` "
"first)."
